1
00:00:00,924 --> 00:00:02,594
(Amy:)- Hi.
- Hello.

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:04,219
(Amy:)What are you doing here?

3
00:00:04,386 --> 00:00:06,306
Well, uh, we just wanted to apologize...

4
00:00:06,471 --> 00:00:08,641
(Penny:)...for not bringing you with us
the other day.

5
00:00:08,807 --> 00:00:11,437
(Amy:)That's not necessary.
It's like Sesame Street says:

6
00:00:11,601 --> 00:00:13,731
"One of these things
is not like the others.

7
00:00:13,895 --> 00:00:16,315
One of these things should die alone."

8
00:00:17,482 --> 00:00:19,572
No, come on, Amy,
Iet us make it up to you.

9
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:22,274
We'll have a girls' night.
We'll do whatever you want.

10
00:00:22,445 --> 00:00:25,115
(Bernadette:)We can go down to the Korean baths
and do that thing...

11
00:00:25,282 --> 00:00:27,452
(Bernadette:)...where we wash each other.

12
00:00:28,785 --> 00:00:31,785
(Penny:)With loofah mitts, no hands.

13
00:00:33,248 --> 00:00:35,128
(Amy:)It's okay. I'm glad this happened.

14
00:00:35,292 --> 00:00:37,622
(Amy:)I can stop pretending
that some beautiful girl...

15
00:00:37,794 --> 00:00:41,214
...and her cute-in-the-right-light friend
wanna hang out with me.

16
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:45,090
- Amy, we're really sorry.
- Yeah, we feel awful.

17
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,470
(Amy:)Don't. I'll be okay.

18
00:00:46,636 --> 00:00:50,266
(Amy:)You're not the first girls I thought
were friends who ended up shunning me.

19
00:00:50,432 --> 00:00:54,272
(Amy:)It's like elementary school, junior high,
high school, undergrad, grad school...

20
00:00:54,436 --> 00:00:57,106
(Amy:)...and that semester abroad in Norway
all over again.

21
00:00:57,272 --> 00:00:58,442
(Penny:)Oh, come on, Amy.

22
00:00:59,983 --> 00:01:01,813
(Amy:)You don't get it.

